There is a 1/13 chance that a glowing potion will contain a djinni.  
If the potion is blessed, he will always grant you a wish.  This is 
great if glowing potions happen to be common potions like object
detection.  (If the potion is cursed, he'll attack.  If the potion
is uncursed, it varies).

Similarly, there's a 1/13 chance that smoky potions contain ghosts.

